WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:06.720
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain a fantasy drama film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:16.240
called “Marriage Simulator.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:22.560
In the opening scene, we are introduced to a&nbsp;
beautiful Japanese girl named Chiharu Takajo. She&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:28.880
is stranded at a bus stop because of the pouring&nbsp;
rain. A young man, Yuichi Tokunagi gets off a bus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:34.720
and joins her. He tries to start a conversation&nbsp;
with Chiharu but she is dismissive of his efforts.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:40.320
Yuichi takes the hint and quits talking. They&nbsp;
wait for the rain to stop in complete silence.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:45.840
But after waiting for several minutes, both of&nbsp;
them get bored. Yuichi notices a film’s poster&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:50.720
behind them and comments that he had always&nbsp;
wanted to watch it. Chiharu also claims that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:56.480
she hasn’t watched a movie in a long time. The&nbsp;
pair goes silent again but Yuichi takes a chance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.480 --> 00:01:01.680
and asks Chiharu to go out on a movie date with&nbsp;
him. She is left stunned and is quite nervous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:06.160
about going out with a stranger. But Yuichi&nbsp;
doesn’t give her a chance to answer and runs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:12.080
to buy two tickets. Chiharu smiles at him and&nbsp;
the two start to date from that day onwards.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:16.480
They are so madly in love with each other&nbsp;
that after dating for only a few months,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:21.280
they decide to get married. A wedding planner&nbsp;
gives them a tour of a chapel and briefs them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:26.480
about the anniversary gift services they provide.&nbsp;
The couple buys a package where their anniversary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:31.680
gifts till the tenth year of their marriage will&nbsp;
be sent by the company. The gift for the tenth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:37.360
anniversary is a customized video that they will&nbsp;
have to shoot for their future selves. Chiharu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:43.360
excitedly compares the videos to a time capsule,&nbsp;
however, Yuichi is not so confident about it. Yet,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:48.320
he agrees to participate for his fiance. 
In the following scene, they shoot the videos&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:52.480
professionally. Yuichi awkwardly asks&nbsp;
the camera about their tenth anniversary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:57.440
while Chiharu leaves a delightful message for&nbsp;
a thirty-five-year-old Yuichi. That evening,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:02.240
they go to the wedding planner to finalize&nbsp;
their venue. As they talk, Chiharu notices&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:07.520
an advertisement for a package that the company&nbsp;
provides. It describes a special program that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:12.480
helps a couple to take a look at their future life&nbsp;
with each other. The planner says that the program&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:18.000
is called the marriage stimulator and most couples&nbsp;
use it to find out if they are really compatible.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:23.920
He asks them if they want to apply but the pair&nbsp;
is skeptical. When Chiharu returns home that day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:28.080
she and her roommate talk about her upcoming&nbsp;
marriage. According to her roommate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:33.360
the couple is making the decision hastily. Chiharu&nbsp;
claims that they are happy in their relationship&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:42.160
and know that they are making a good decision.&nbsp;
The roommate jokingly gives the example of a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:48.080
dress that Chiharu impulsively bought some&nbsp;
months ago and wore only once. She suggests&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:52.480
Chiharu think about the marriage again because&nbsp;
they have been dating for only a few months.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:57.760
When she expresses her relief about not marrying&nbsp;
her former boyfriend, Chiharu starts to question&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:02.400
her decision. To be absolutely sure about&nbsp;
marrying him, she decides to apply to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:07.920
marriage stimulator program and convinces Yuichi&nbsp;
as well. In the following scene, they are at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:12.880
company’s headquarters discussing the program.
The officials explain that the scientists can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:17.920
predict how the couple’s marriage life will&nbsp;
be by examining their DNA, their medical data,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:23.280
their personal background, and their character&nbsp;
profile. This way, their future married life is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:29.360
stimulated in the form of a dream and shown to the&nbsp;
couple. Following that, they acquire Chiharu and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:34.400
Yuichi’s blood samples and several medical&nbsp;
data, along with their background history.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:40.000
Then the two are seated in special chairs and&nbsp;
a device is attached to their heads. The doctor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:45.280
warns them that the future they see through the&nbsp;
device is not absolute and might change according&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:51.040
to their emotional reactions. Finally, the&nbsp;
device starts, and they are made to fall asleep.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:55.920
At first, the couple dreams about their wedding&nbsp;
day. They stand in front of the guests who cheer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.920 --> 00:04:00.720
for them, happily stepping into the next part of&nbsp;
their lives. The first morning after the wedding,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:06.000
they wake up and are just as happy. Chiharu has&nbsp;
made breakfast for Yuichi that the two enjoy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:11.680
together; that is until they realize that they&nbsp;
prefer different side dishes with their breakfast.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:16.640
It is only a small compromise that the two&nbsp;
have to make but it doesn’t end there. 
&nbsp;

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:22.160
Chiharu discovers that Yuichi always leaves the&nbsp;
toilet seat up which causes a minor argument,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:27.120
again, one of them has to compromise. When they&nbsp;
go to sleep at night, Chiharu has the habit of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:34.800
leaving the lights open but Yuichi cannot fall&nbsp;
asleep with them on. In the same way, as time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:40.000
passes, the couple eventually realizes that their&nbsp;
lifestyles are very different from each other.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:45.280
One day, Chiharu has enough of her husband not&nbsp;
listening to her, so she tells him that she feels&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:50.560
unappreciated. Yuichi, on the other hand, puts&nbsp;
the blame on her for never dressing up, putting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.560 --> 00:05:02.480
on makeup, and looking pretty. Following that, the&nbsp;
couple is woken up for a break. They are clearly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:07.280
not happy after watching what their future will&nbsp;
be like. They try to be optimistic and assume that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:11.920
they will eventually get used to living with each&nbsp;
other. Yuichi says that no matter what happens,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:16.480
he will not leave her side. While going down&nbsp;
the elevator, they come across another couple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:22.000
who has also just seen their future. The girl is&nbsp;
crying because the man is about to cheat on her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:26.080
He tries to explain that he would never do&nbsp;
something like that but the marriage stimulator&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:32.560
has already predicted the future. Sometime later,&nbsp;
they continue the stimulation and dream of Chiharu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:37.440
being pregnant. They discuss the possible names&nbsp;
for their child and decide to name it Haruki&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:42.640
if it is a boy and Yuka if it is a girl. 
In a few months, Chiharu gives birth to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:48.000
a beautiful boy. Her mother-in-law calls him&nbsp;
Yutaro. Chiharu looks at Yuichi uncomfortably,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:52.800
asking him why his mother is calling their son&nbsp;
a different name. The woman laughs and claims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:57.360
that according to their family’s tradition, the&nbsp;
first kid should be something with the letter Y.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:03.120
Yuichi doesn’t want to go against his mother so he&nbsp;
just accepts the name while Chiharu is furious at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:08.720
him for not mentioning this before. On their fifth&nbsp;
anniversary, Chiharu prepares him a dinner at home&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:14.960
and waits for him for hours. Yuichi comes home at&nbsp;
midnight and says that he has already eaten at a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:20.480
business dinner. Chiharu is clearly hurt and upset&nbsp;
but Yuichi is dismissive of her effort to make him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:25.920
happy. She suggests they go out for dinner the&nbsp;
next day, but Yuichi has to attend a golf match.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:31.200
Chiharu remembers the day they had met for the&nbsp;
first time and reminisces about how good life was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:36.720
then. Chiharu finally tells him that she is hurt&nbsp;
to which he replies that he works hard to provide&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:42.320
for the family, so she should be happy instead.&nbsp;
He harshly asks her to stop bitching so much&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:47.920
and be satisfied with what she has for once. 
In the following scene, the couple is talking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:52.960
about Yutaro’s school fees. Chiharu wants to&nbsp;
start working to be able to provide their kid&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:58.880
with better things but Yuichi insists he already&nbsp;
earns enough for the family, Chiharu accuses him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:03.040
of trying to keep her in the house because&nbsp;
he doesn’t want her to grow professionally.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:07.840
The two get into yet another argument and start&nbsp;
yelling at each other. They both argue that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:12.800
have sacrificed a lot for the family but are&nbsp;
oblivious of what the other person has done.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:18.560
As their screams start getting louder, poor Yutaro&nbsp;
comes to their room crying because he is scared.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:24.480
Chiharu quickly gets up and calms him down. As she&nbsp;
is hugging the kid, Yuichi approaches her and says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:31.200
that they should separate for good. Chiharu just&nbsp;
hugs her son tighter and cries. In the next scene,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:36.640
they finally sign the divorce paper. Moments&nbsp;
later, the pair wakes up in the chair. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:45.520
officials ask them about their experience but&nbsp;
they stay frozen in their seats. After composing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:50.960
themselves, they get up and confront each other.&nbsp;
Chiharu is beyond hurt by what she just witnessed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:56.720
She slaps Yuichi, calling him a liar for promising&nbsp;
that he will always stick by her side. Yuichi has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.720 --> 00:08:01.040
nothing else to say. He simply claims that it&nbsp;
is better they know this before their wedding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:05.920
because now they can take a step back and prevent&nbsp;
themselves from wasting time on each other.
&nbsp;

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:14.640
With that kind of future, they do not want to&nbsp;
marry anymore. Yuichi asks his wedding planner&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:19.440
to cancel the ceremony. The officials are&nbsp;
shocked but they respect the pair’s decision.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:24.400
Chiharu returns home but she feels like she&nbsp;
is missing a part of herself after breaking up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:30.560
with Yuichi. Her roommate tries to console her and&nbsp;
advises her to never marry because all men change&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:35.600
after marriage. But the advice does little to&nbsp;
nothing to help her mood. For the next few days,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:40.640
she keeps herself busy with work. If she is free,&nbsp;
she either goes swimming or hangs out with her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:46.160
friend to keep the thought of Yuichi out of her&nbsp;
mind. One day, she returns home to see that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:50.800
has received a package from the wedding planner&nbsp;
that contains the video Yuichi was supposed to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:55.760
give her on their tenth wedding anniversary. As&nbsp;
she contemplates playing it, she gets a call from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:55.760 --> 00:09:01.120
Yuichi. It turns out that the company accidentally&nbsp;
sent them the opposite tapes so he asks her to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:06.560
throw them away. Chiharu says that she will, but&nbsp;
after the call, she can’t help but play it, hoping&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:12.720
to see him one last time. In the video, Yuichi&nbsp;
greets her and apologizes for all the mistakes he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:18.160
has made throughout the years. He admits he can be&nbsp;
non-communicative sometimes and claims that even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:23.520
though he doesn’t say it, he loves her a lot. 
To Chiharu’s surprise, he also confesses that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:30.480
the time they met at the bus stop was&nbsp;
not the first time he saw her. In fact,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:35.920
he had seen her at the train station one day and&nbsp;
instantly knew she was the one. Following that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:40.400
he always looked forward to seeing her around the&nbsp;
neighborhood. He wanted to approach her but never&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:45.120
had the guts until he saw her at the bus stop&nbsp;
that day. He had even left his umbrella on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:50.320
bus so he could spend some time with her. Yuichi&nbsp;
ends the video by telling her that they should go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:55.200
to a movie theatre and see if they are showing a&nbsp;
romantic film, if they are by chance showing one,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.200 --> 00:10:04.240
that will mean that they were always meant to be.&nbsp;
By the end of the video, Chiharu is left sobbing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:08.960
She has a hundred things going on in her mind.&nbsp;
Without thinking much, she runs to the movie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:14.320
theatre that they went to on their first date. To&nbsp;
her disappointment, it is showing a horror movie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:21.040
instead of a romantic one. She is about to return&nbsp;
when Yuichi also arrives there and asks her to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:26.960
come to the movies with him. The pair smiles&nbsp;
at each other and reunites. Then, we find out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:31.520
that they have been watching the stimulation till&nbsp;
now. Them canceling the wedding was also a part of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:37.120
the simulation. The couple opens their eyes, still&nbsp;
trying to comprehend the rollercoaster of emotions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:41.760
they have felt in the past two hours. 
They get up from their seats and do not say a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:45.840
word to each other. The planner congratulates&nbsp;
them and asks them about the experience,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:51.840
still, the pair doesn’t speak. In the following&nbsp;
scene, we see them walking down a park. They have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.840 --> 00:10:56.480
not talked to each other since watching the&nbsp;
stimulation. After walking for a long time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.480 --> 00:11:00.960
they hold hands and smile at each other. 
